<title>USA: Niagara Mohawk Nine Mile Point 2 nuke shuts--NRC.</title>
<headline>Niagara Mohawk Nine Mile Point 2 nuke shuts--NRC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Niagara Mohawk Power Corp's 1,137 megawatt (MW) Nine Mile Point 2 nuclear unit in Scriba, N.Y., shut late Thursday for repairs, the Nuclear Regulatory Commission said in its Friday morning plant status report.  </p>
<p>The unit is in hot shutdown mode due to a &quot;required shutdown,&quot; the NRC report stated.</p>
<p>No possible restart date was yet available.</p>
<p>(( New York Power Desk +212-859-1628))</p>
</text>
